flowchart TD
    A[Start Server] --> B[Start Ollama Server]
    B --> C[Ollama Server Ready]
    C --> D[Initialize LLM Connection]
    D --> E[Load llama3.1:8b Model]
    E --> F[LLM Ready]
    F --> G[Start MCP Client Manager]
    G --> H[Initialize Database Tools]
    H --> I[MCP Tools Ready]
    I --> J[Initialize Logging]
    J --> K[Logging Ready]
    K --> L[Navigate to AI Chat]
    L --> M[Initialize Chat Interface]
    M --> N[Create Capture Intelligence Agent]
    N --> O[Connect Agent to Tools]
    O --> P[Agent Ready]
    P --> Q[Display Chat UI]
    Q --> R[User Enters Query]
    R --> S[Process User Message in ai_chat.py]
    S --> T[Log User Input]
    T --> U[Agent Processes Query]
    U --> V[LLM Handles Query]
    V --> W[Does LLM Need Tool]?
    W -- Yes --> X[MCP Tool Call (e.g., Database)]
    X --> Y[Return Tool Result to LLM]
    Y --> Z[LLM Generates Final Response]
    W -- No --> Z
    Z